<lab name="Asymmetry Routing Lab 1" id="b088fa5c-f8f3-496d-b237-34b70ad91021" version="0" scripttimeout="600" countdown="0" linkwidth="1" lock="0" grid="1" sat="-1">
  <description>Asymmetry Routing Lab 
                                                   +-- R2 --+               +-- R4 --+
192.168.7.0/24 LAN1 -- R1 --+            +--- R3 ----+            +-- R5 -- LAN7192.168.1.0/24 
                                                   +-- R7 --+                +-- R6 --+     

Forward: R1 -&gt; R2 -&gt; R3 -&gt; R4 -&gt; R5
Return:  R5 -&gt; R6 -&gt; R3 -&gt; R7 -&gt; R1</description>
